  "ingredients": [
    "8 small lobster tails",
    "0.5 cup salted butter, melted",
    "0.5 tablespoon garlic powder",
    "1 teaspoon dried parsley",
    "1 pinch seafood seasoning (such as Old Bay®), or to taste",
    "0.5 lemon, juiced"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients, and preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iw2-92uFrT32WTrQLmBcC7X7s-k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-282923-baked-lobster-tails-step-01-42a4724995a84aa2a11616cf27a953ce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282923/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut lobster tails straight down the middle using kitchen shears.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ar9WlFV5BSwEVFjWPYhHeHNzaus=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-282923-baked-lobster-tails-step-02-0b0b2cd85b904305a4622aa740bb230c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282923/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Butterfly the lobster meat by pulling it through the opening and laying the meat on top of the shell; place in an oven-safe baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dfbsWlBg7VB5i_2cm4hPtfS25Xo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-282923-baked-lobster-tails-step-03-5b6e6e66a3b542b9be1af57a2185a2e0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282923/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine melted butter, garlic powder, and parsley in a bowl. Mix together with a spoon.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eEmeCRiCi3izmlyriS6Vhh5ncBo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-282923-baked-lobster-tails-step-04-ac2f539adf6348ce8f378ef79f48b52f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282923/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season lobster tails with seafood seasoning and pour melted butter mixture on top until each tail is completely covered. Squeeze lemon juice over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h1MqQLgMtLrnIljiN-6918TFGU0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-282923-baked-lobster-tails-step-05-8abeb2243b2c4177b7e3efe20c36cacf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282923/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until shells are bright red and meat is opaque, 12 to 15 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the centers should read 140 to 145 degrees F (60 to 63 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
